<form id="token-form" class="phonetic-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
  <div class="phonetic-field">
    <label for="server-token">Local server token</label>
    <input id="server-token" type="password" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="new-password" autocapitalize="off">
    <label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" id="show-server-token"> Show token</label>
  </div>
  <p>When <code>python3 python/shared/server.py</code> starts, it prints a new token in its terminal. Paste it here. The server refuses every request without it, so no other program on this device can use it. The token changes each time the server starts, and it is not saved.</p>
</form>
